/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+7% of your Sword Fighting as extra damage for auto-attacks</div></div></div>\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_block weapon_proficiency_border\"><div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_icon\" title=\"Cooldown Reduction Perk\">\n<div><img alt=\"16?cb=20250625080425&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Skillwheel_Small_Perk_Icons_a3449f.png\"/></div>\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img38\"><img alt=\"38?cb=20220930163859&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Intense_Wound_Cleansing_31680c.gif\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">-30s cooldown for Intense Wound Cleansing</div></div>\n<div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_icon\" title=\"Weapon Shield Mod\">\n<div></div>\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img32\"><img alt=\"32?cb=20251104183605&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_General_ed04f0.png\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+1 defence modifier</div></div>\n<div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_icon\" title=\"Sword Percentage Spell Healing\">\n<div></div>\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img32\"><img alt=\"32?cb=20250629110322&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Gain_Extra_Healing_Spells_e39b25.png\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+10% of your Sword Fighting as extra healing for your spells</div></div></div>\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_block weapon_proficiency_border\"><div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_icon\" title=\"Life Leech Perk\">\n<div><img alt=\"16?cb=20250625080425&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Skillwheel_Small_Perk_Icons_a3449f.png\"/></div>\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img38\"><img alt=\"38?cb=20221003210427&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Berserk_322877.gif\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+10% life leech for Berserk</div></div>\n<div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_icon\" title=\"Mana Perk\">\n<div><img alt=\"16?cb=20250625080425&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Skillwheel_Small_Perk_Icons_a3449f.png\"/></div>\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img38\"><img alt=\"38?cb=20221003210427&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Berserk_322877.gif\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+5% mana leech for Berserk</div></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>It is also known as the Sword of Valor or \"SoV\".</li>\n<li>After Taghor found the Magic Longsword, which was misplaced by a mapper, Guido demanded the sword and gave him a Magic Sword as compensation.</li>\n<li>Its attack value was changed from 50 to 48 with Update 7.0.</li>\n<li>Before the quest system (and <a href=\"#/quest/the-annihilator-quest\">The Annihilator Quest</a>) was introduced in the Christmas Update 2003, there existed 128 Swords of Valor on Antica. This was counted on The Burg Waldeck-Convention 2003. A majority of these swords were created by duping.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-sellto\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th>NPC</th><th>Location</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/H.L.\">H.L.</a></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Outlaw%20Camp\">Outlaw Camp</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">350 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=